API.md E3: over examples/features/entries, Add to a keyed list whose key field names an existing
element, here one in an entry file, is ErrKeyExists: the duplicate a check reports as E3102.
-- options --
example: features/entries
pkgs: features.entries
-- edit.json --
{"ops": [
  {"op": "add", "path": "ranks", "source": "{ code: \"captain\", title: \"Again\" }"}
]}
-- project.canon --
project acme {
  canon: "0.1"
}
-- result.json --
{
  "error": "op 0: key already exists"
}
